WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.005
No agents connected yet.

2
00:00:08.005 --> 00:00:16.006
An agent asks to connect.

3
00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:26.002
You see what it may do, then allow it.

4
00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:34.001
It reads your notes.

5
00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:44.003
It writes one; you see it at once.

6
00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:52.002
Same permissions as you, nothing more.

7
00:00:52.002 --> 00:01:02.004
Every agent you allowed, in one place.

8
00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:09.001
Disconnect it.

9
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:14.840
Its next call is refused.
